+ ("thm-two-maps-into-a-convex-set-are-homotopic","literature-derived","ai-altered","exact-source",[POSTECH],"The source states that any two continuous maps into a convex Euclidean set are homotopic by the straight-line homotopy."),
+ ("cor-convex-subsets-of-rn-are-contractible","literature-derived","ai-altered","exact-source",[POSTECH],"The source states and proves that every convex subset of Euclidean space is contractible by the same formula."),
