+ ("ex-a-cylinder-deformation-retracts-onto-an-end","ai-altered","ai-generated","semantic-source",[AT],"Hatcher's deformation-retraction definition and mapping-cylinder discussion use the same product-interval contraction; this item writes the cylinder formula for an arbitrary space."),
+ ("ex-radial-deformation-retraction-of-punctured-rn","literature-derived","ai-altered","exact-source",[MIT],"The MIT notes give exactly the radial retraction of punctured Euclidean space onto the unit sphere with the same homotopy."),
