+        "cor-two-continuous-maps-into-a-hausdorff-space-agreeing-on-a-dense-set-are-equal": "statement and steps 1.1 through 3.1 include the coincident-map case",
+        "lem-a-sequence-in-a-hausdorff-space-has-at-most-one-limit": "steps 1.1 and 6.1 isolate equality of the two proposed limits as the degenerate conclusion",
