+        "fs-homotopy-equivalent-spaces-are-homeomorphic": "step 2.1 supplies the identity and constant composite endpoints",
+        "ex-straight-line-homotopy-between-maps-into-rn": "step 2.1 verifies H(x,0)=f(x) and H(x,1)=g(x)",
+        "ex-intervals-and-euclidean-spaces-are-contractible": "step 2.1 invokes contractions with identity and constant endpoints",
+        "ex-a-point-and-r-are-homotopy-equivalent-not-homeomorphic": "step 2.1 supplies both composite endpoint conditions",
+        "ex-a-two-point-retract-that-is-not-a-deformation-retract": "step 1.2 uses the identity-to-retraction endpoint condition",
