- Δ-system → `https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delta-system_lemma`
- Sorgenfrey line/plane → `https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_limit_topology`, `https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sorgenfrey_plane`
